{"product_id":"geekvape-baron-24mm-bf-rda","title":"GeekVape Baron 24mm BF RDA Tank","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Geek Vape BARON 24mm RDA is a performance dripper implementing a large expansive two-post build deck and multifunctional airflow system for a dynamic range of vapor production output unlike any other. The Geek Vape BARON hosts a dual post build deck, top secured via flathead screws arranged in a single or dual coil layout. Airflow for the BARON RDA is drawn through the slotted top cap, past the selected airflow option of the fixed inner cap and vents directly to the coil configuration through either a slotted or drilled 3x4 hole pattern.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the base of the Baron sits a stainless steel 510 connector that can accept a gold-plated BF squonk pin to allow for squonking of eJuice onto the coil configuration with the gentle pump from today's best squonk mods. In addition, the Baron is lightly knurled at the top cap to provide a better grip for those trying to adjust the airflow. Catering to cloud chasers, the BARON RDA comes with multiple drip tip options, such as a large PMMA widebore and a beautiful Resin widebore drip tip with the option of 510 drip tip adapter.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGeek Vape BARON 24mm RDA Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e24mm Diameter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDeep Juice Wells\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSuperior Stainless Steel Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTwo Post Build Deck - Large Terminals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Secured via Flathead Screws\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePEEK Insulator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSingle or Dual Coil Configuration\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFixed Position Multifunctional Airflow Inner Cap - Various Airflow Designs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKnurled Top Cap for Easy Airflow Adjustment\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e810 Widebore Resin Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e810 Widebore PMMA Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Squonk BF Pin\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGold-Plated 510 Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDetachable Structure\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Stainless Steel, Gunmetal, Black, Gold, Rainbow, Violet, Blue\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 BARON 24mm RDA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 PMMA Drip Tip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 510 Drip Tip Adapter\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Feather Cotton\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Pre-Built Coils\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Geek Vape Flathead Screwdriver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Hex Wrench\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Spare Parts Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Promotion Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Geekvape","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215312951,"sku":"GeekV Baron 24mm BF RDA Tank","price":2100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/geek_vape_baron_24mm_bf_rda.jpg?v=1752512503","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/geekvape-baron-24mm-bf-rda","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




